{"id":"psfstriptable.1","n":"psfstriptable","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"kbd","ver":"2.4.0-11.el9","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/k/kbd-2.4.0-11.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/psfstriptable.1.gz","sha256":"4b2b8154baf1ff02686c2c7342172e305f2554daf07174910835247443ff41d0","date":"25 Oct 1994","origin":"kbd"},"u":{"pkg":"kbd","ver":"2.3.0-3ubuntu4.22.04","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/k/kbd/kbd_2.3.0-3ubuntu4.22.04_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/psfstriptable.1.gz","sha256":"cb72c183582891404321c7f3401167ffa9f8c0afef58070f26714bb7939aa1f3","date":"25 Oct 1994","origin":"kbd"}},"nopt":{"r":0,"u":0},"desc":"remove the embedded Unicode character table from a console font","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>psfstriptable - remove the embedded Unicode character table from a console font</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>psfstriptable</b> <i>fontfile outfile</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>psfstriptable</b> reads a .psf format console font from <i>fontfile</i>, removes the embedded Unicode font table if there is one, and writes the result to <i>outfile</i>. An input file name of \"-\" denotes standard input, and an output file name of \"-\" denotes standard output.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>setfont</b>(8), <b>psfaddtable</b>(1), <b>psfgettable</b>(1), <b>psfxtable</b>(1)</p>"]]}